      "text": "El Centro Sector agents working in Calexico, CA arrested an illegal alien sought by Mexican authorities for armed robbery. Crossing an international border does not erase criminal records—it expands the scope of law enforcement cooperation.\n\nThrough coordinated efforts with Mexican authorities, agents located and took the individual into custody without incident. This operation demonstrates the strong partnership between the United States and Mexico to ensure that individuals wanted for violent offenses are held accountable.\n\nThe illegal alien was turned over to the Government of Mexico where he will face his charges.\n\n#HonorFirst #PremierSector #USBP #ElCentroSector #CBP #DHS",
