      "text": "Aftermarket wasn’t the only thing hidden here.\n\n#Indio agents stopped a vehicle near Niland, CA that didn’t pass the smell test…literally. A K9 helped agents discover an aftermarket part on the vehicle that was more than just a “performance upgrade.”\n\nThe aftermarket part was serving as a hidden compartment holding five packages of heroin. Another drug load stopped before it can poison our communities.\n\n#PremierSector doing premier things.\n\n #HonorFirst #USBP #ElCentroSector #CBP #DHS",
