      "text": "El Centro Sector Border Patrol welcomed Deputy Chief of Staff for the Department of War Patrick Weaver to the Imperial Valley! \n\nMr. Weaver engaged in crucial discussions with U.S. Military personnel and El Centro Sector leadership, strengthening our collaborative efforts to secure our nation’s border, underscoring the vital inter-agency partnerships that support our mission. \n\nA brief but impactful trip to the border provided firsthand insight into the dedication and hard work of our agents.\n\n#CBP #BorderSecurity #ElCentroSector #USBP #NationalSecurity #Collaboration #USMarines",
      "text_resolved": "El Centro Sector Border Patrol welcomed Deputy Chief of Staff for the Department of War Patrick Weaver to the Imperial Valley! \n\nMr. Weaver engaged in crucial discussions with U.S. Military personnel and El Centro Sector leadership, strengthening our collaborative efforts to secure our nation’s border, underscoring the vital inter-agency partnerships that support our mission. \n\nA brief but impactful trip to the border provided firsthand insight into the dedication and hard work of our agents.\n\n#CBP #BorderSecurity #ElCentroSector #USBP #NationalSecurity #Collaboration #USMarines",
