      "retweeted_tweet_id": null,
      "text": "Let there be no doubt: Our dedicated agents in the #ElCentroSector are on the front lines, relentlessly safeguarding our communities. We have made significant arrests in the Coachella Valley, taking down individuals responsible for heinous crimes including murder, assault, and sexual assault.\n\nEl Centro Sector continues to conduct full spectrum immigration enforcement, ensuring that dangerous individuals who threaten public safety are removed from our streets. Our mission is clear, our commitment is absolute, and we will not be deterred from protecting our neighborhoods and bringing those who commit crimes to justice.\n\n#USBP #PremierSector #CoachellaValley #California #Indio",
